ree's uncommitted tree was\n18|  recomputed through a temporary index copy before and after this review and equals the CR tree\n19|  both times; the live index (mtime 19:26, before this run started) was not written. Every\n20|  measurement below was taken on three `git archive` copies of that tree\n21|  (`.temp/TASK-260830-35urbp/review-rev4/{candidate,mutant-copy,probe-copy}`), each hashed to\n22|  `c978fd70` through a scratch index before use and after every battery pass. No product edit,\n23|  commit, checkpoint or integration was performed; `git status` in the live worktree is unchanged\n24|  (`M LOGBOOK.md`, `M README.md`, `?? internal/tmuxserver/`).\n25|- Normative authority: pinned `internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.7.0.md` §3.2 (806-813), §4.2 (1403-1449),\n26|  §4.3 (1458), §4.4 (1478-1488), with §4.C/§4.D/§4.E as context. The task record's v0.5.0 Scope is\n27|  stale; the candidate cites the pinned file only (no `0.5.0` anywhere in the package).\n28|- Note on the rev4 reviewer brief: its templated line \"revisions 1..3 carry no review verdict\" is\n29|  wrong for this task — rev1 (RUN-260921-0245e5), rev2 (RUN-260921-5a9d4b) and rev3\n30|  (RUN-260921-2369f7) were all reviewed and routed CHANGES REQUESTED. Rev4 was reviewed on its\n31|  own merits AND against closure of every rev3 finding.\n32|\n33|## What was reproduced (all on tree c978fd70; PATH without any tmux binary, TMUX/TMUX_TMPDIR unset, no tmux process on the host; umask 022, uid 502, darwin/arm64, go1.25.5)\n34|\n35|| Check | Result | Log (evidence archive) |\n36|| --- | --- | --- |\n37|| Configured suite, 30 commands read from `spawn.worktree_isolation.validation.commands` (count 30, verified by read) | **30/30 exit 0, every command rerun by this reviewer in one sequential pass** (`suite-exits.txt` carries every exit and duration): 1 gofmt, 2 build, 3 vet; 4 `go test ./... -count=1 -v` (167s): 45/45 ok, 0 package FAIL, 0 top-level `--- FAIL`, 14 pre-existing SKIP outside this package, 0 SKIP in `interna