at the code does (lookup keys recorded without validation); `ObserveAmbient` now returns `Ambient` only; both observation tests updated | — (signature change; callers fail to compile otherwise) | `internal/tmuxserver/socket.go`, `socket_test.go` |\n35|| P3-E two refusal arms pinned by detail in prose only | `TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesReadOnlyRoot` (`runtime commit`, non-root bound B14) + `N-commit-eacces-as-exist` (reviewer's R04; kills by reroute to the absent refusal, still fail-closed); whitespace-only override subtests at both levels + `N-override-whitespace` (reviewer's R07); new rows 57/58 | `TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesReadOnlyRoot`, `TestAcquireRefusesEveryAmbientOverrideVector/whitespace_only` | `harness-pass1/N-commit-eacces-as-exist.log`, `harness-pass1/N-override-whitespace.log` (+ pass 2) |\n36|| Obs zero-UID broker model, AfterMkdir naming, unreachable guard arm, generation-only socket binding | B21 states the zero-`BrokerReport` model and the generation-only socket binding; B15 gains the unreachable guard arm (error-arm row, never a narrowing); the `AfterMkdir` comment now says created-or-present (no rename — the crash seam held) | — (bounds/prose, no behavior) | `TRACEABILITY.md` B15/B21, `runtime.go` |\n37|\n38|Kept untouched per the verdict: the dedicated-server rule per vector,\n39|the background broker-or-refuse wiring with the literal\n40|`capability_unavailable` and typed details, the no-fallback rule along\n41|the caller/credential/platform axes, the landed-admission attestation\n42|composition, the custody gates that held under attack (FIFO/symlink/\n43|mode/UID/handle-mismatch refusals, the explicit `Fchmod`, the\n44|real-SIGKILL crash test), the determinism design (no real-tmux\n45|witness), and the `internal/traceability` boundary.\n46|\n47|## Deliverable (rev4 shape)\n48|\n49|`internal/tmuxserver`, composing the landed owners (never forked):\n50|\n51|- (1) Runtime custody: `EnsureRuntimeDir` / `VerifyRuntimeDir` with\n52|  three independent gates (containment, exact `0700`, eUID ownership).\n53|  Foreground acquisition ensures idempotently; background acquisition\n54|  verifies the existing directory and never creates it. Absence\n55|  (`ENOENT`) carries its own detail; the missing-root mapping is one\n56|  shared classifier.\n57|- (2) Dedicated socket: `SocketPath` / `ResolveSocket` derive\n58|  `<root>/tmux/ax.sock` — the spec's path — and refuse overrides and\n59|  ambient collisions on all five members, with the TMUX member\n60|  compared in its real encoding and unclean spellings cleaned\n61|  (symlink aliases bound).\n62|- (3) Acquisition: `Acquire` refuses malformed input, ambient reuse,\n63|  and missing dependencies before any side effect. Foreground attaches\n64|  or spawns (a running server never spawns, even with empty\n65|  admission); background brokers-or-refuses with the typed\n66|  `capability_unavailable` — including the absent-leaf cold state —\n67|  and no fallback (the miss path consults the creation gate by call;\n68|  every background test arms a zero-call spy).\n69|- (4) Readiness: `CheckServerAttested` / `CheckBrokerContact` decide\n70|  the landed admission (`Admitted.Has(realm)` + generation equality)\n71|  over a typed same-user generation-bound broker principal. A stale\n72|  admission — the replayed-cached shape — refuses on both paths.\n73|- (5) Spawn argv: `BuildArgv` emits exactly\n74|  `tmux -S socket new-session -d -s session ax pane session`\n75|  through the landed argv gate. Native Windows refuses every request.\n76|\n77|Extended vs deliberately not extended (unchanged from rev3; the\n78|reviewer verified each claim rather than accepting it):\n79|\n80|- Extended (composed): `terminalbackend.Admitted` (attestation\n81|  verdict), `axpane` caller vocabulary, `axerror` typed refusal,\n82|  `scalar` platform/path/UUIDv7 grammars, `secprim` Guard /\n83|  `OpenNoFollowDir` / `CheckArgv`, the `localstore` Runtime IPC root\n84|  (`PathRuntime`, consumed as the caller-su