mand, no\n2385|`doctor` result, and no runtime capability claim; the clause-to-test\n2386|matrix with its stated bounds lives in\n2387|[the task evidence map](internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md).\n2388|\n2389|## Ownership reducer properties\n2390|\n2391|The four story-pinned ownership invariants (pinned v0.6.0 Sections 2.2, 5.3,\n2392|and 13.6-13.10) hold as executable property tests over the landed production\n2393|reducers — `sessstate.Reduce` with `Compare` and the union projection,\n2394|`sessrepo.WinningLease` with `ListLeases`, and `fencing.Authorize*`:\n2395|\n2396|1. Union-order independence: every permutation of a union multiset, and every\n2397|   partition into successive unions, projects byte-identically (winner,\n2398|   conflicts, divergent-history warnings). Losing-branch evidence is a pure\n(more lines below)","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
