{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ca29","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c4ab-e99a-71a1-b01c-d4e1f789add0"},"sequence":879,"recorded_at":1780531400001753,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"e9eaa535-0e9f-444e-ac97-d216243d9df7","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"e9eaa535-0e9f-444e-ac97-d216243d9df7","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"e9eaa535-0e9f-444e-ac97-d216243d9df7"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c4af-e653-7c61-8032-a8a6ca736e9c"},"task_id":"01a0c4af-e653-7c61-8032-a8a6ca736e9c","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c4af-e653-7c61-8032-a8a6ca736e9c","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 84-95\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-\t// Root and Name select the runtime directory: Root is the\n-\t// Runtime IPC root of the SPEC 3.2 table (macOS: per-user\n-\t// temporary directory; Linux/WSL2: $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/ax),\n-\t// resolved by the landed localstore layout as PathRuntime and\n-\t// supplied by the caller — this leaf resolves no root of its\n-\t// own, because the socket is runtime IPC, never durable\n-\t// identity. Name is the runtime leaf (usually\n-\t// RuntimeDirName). Foreground acquisition ensures the directory\n-\t// idempotently; background acquisition verifies the existing\n-\t// directory and never creates it.\n-\tRoot string\n-\tName string\n+\t// Root is the Runtime IPC root of the SPEC 3.2 table (macOS:\n+\t// per-user temporary directory; Linux/WSL2:\n+\t// $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/ax), resolved by the landed localstore\n+\t// layout as PathRuntime and supplied by the caller — this leaf\n+\t// resolves no root of its own, because the socket is runtime\n+\t// IPC, never durable identity. The runtime leaf is not a\n+\t// caller input: Acquire always passes RuntimeDirName, so the\n+\t// derived socket is always <Root>/tmux/ax.sock and no caller\n+\t// spelling can re-open the ambient or conventional names the\n+\t// override gate refuses. Foreground acquisition ensures the\n+\t// directory idempotently; background acquisition verifies the\n+\t// existing directory and never creates it.\n+\tRoot string\n","final_result":true}}}
