{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cc55","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c4ab-e99a-71a1-b01c-d4e1f789add0"},"sequence":1157,"recorded_at":1780531400002309,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"e9eaa535-0e9f-444e-ac97-d216243d9df7","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"e9eaa535-0e9f-444e-ac97-d216243d9df7","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"e9eaa535-0e9f-444e-ac97-d216243d9df7"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c4b1-7257-7ea3-bacc-a0d0af7e7cda"},"task_id":"01a0c4b1-7257-7ea3-bacc-a0d0af7e7cda","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c4b1-7257-7ea3-bacc-a0d0af7e7cda","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-21-1\",\n  \"command\": \"PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/tmuxserver/mutant_harness.py N-absence-remap-widen N-background-absence-remap N-acquire-commit-refusal N-verify-absence-detail 2>&1 | tail -n 8\",\n  \"description\": \"Run key mutants after rework\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"ok: N-acquire-commit-refusal: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly commit-phase custody refusals past the foreground wiring (commit failures carry the joined path; lexical failures carry \\\"\\\"); lexical refusals still refuse. Kill path: the entry probes and spawns past a widened mode. [exit 1]\\nok: N-verify-absence-detail: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly absent leaves past the absence detail (they report containment like an unsafe leaf); ENOTDIR/ELOOP and every other leaf failure still refuse containment. Narrowing, not a delete: the refusal stays, only the ENOENT arm is dropped. Kill paths: the Verify detail mismatch, and the background reroute to the custody code instead of the typed unavailable. [exit 1]\\nok: N-background-absence-remap: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly macOS absences past the unavailable remap (they return the custody code); absences on Linux/WSL2 still map. Kill path: the macOS background cold state reports tmux_unsafe_runtime_dir instead of capability_unavailable. [exit 1]\\nok: N-absence-remap-widen: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly mode refusals past the absence classifier (a widened leaf maps to capability_unavailable with the custody refusal hidden as its redacted cause); absence still maps and every other unsafe-leaf refusal keeps its custody code. Kill path: the background custody test asserts the top-level *Error the caller renders. [exit 1]\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1407,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 352,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
